  "description": "Who doesn't want to be that cool aunt who shows up with the best presents, the funniest jokes, and a grand plan to save her menace of a nephew? When a reader transmigrates into “From Illegitimate Son to Family Head” as Lucella Lilfrey, aunt of the novel's future ultimate villain, Lucian Bellomont, this becomes her new reality. Some strict rules and proper discipline should do the trick, but she faces one massive problem… This tiny terror is just too stinkin’ cute to ever be told “no\"!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68742662), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EB%8B%B9%EC%9D%84-%EB%B0%94%EB%A5%B4%EA%B2%8C-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%B3%B4%EA%B2%A0%EC%8A%B5%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/4790)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://tapas.io/series/ill-raise-the-villain-right/info), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/205699)",
